          MindTopo: Can Foundation Models Reason in Topological Space?
        </h1>
        <p class="title-subtitle">Do MLLMs share the topological intuition that humans build?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="main-subtitle">
    <strong>Key Takeaway: </strong> Frontier models can <strong class="highlight-phrase">recognize a topological relation in a static scene</strong>, but they cannot <strong class="highlight-phrase">maintain or operate on it across an action sequence</strong>.
  </p>

